• Usage: /pdf-update <pdf_path> -- <prompt>

Process PDF: export pages to images and apply image transformations.

Setup required:
1. pip install pdf2image Pillow python-pptx
2. brew install poppler (macOS) or apt install poppler-utils (Linux)

Example:
/pdf-update ~/Documents/report.pdf -- Convert to oil painting style
